    "system": {
        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Blade Byrnie], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Blade Byrnie (Greater)], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Blade Byrnie (Major)]</p>\n<p>You pull a link from the armor, which transforms into a <em>+1 striking dagger</em> (<em>+2 greater striking dagger</em> for <em>greater blade byrnie</em> and <em>+3 greater striking dagger</em> for <em>major blade byrnie</em>). Upgrading the runes on the <em>blade byrnie</em> makes the daggers pulled from it more powerful. The daggers have a <em>+2 weapon potency</em> rune if the armor has a <em>+2 armor potency</em> rune, or a <em>+3 weapon potency</em> rune if the armor has a <em>+3 armor potency</em> rune.</p>"
